note: harvested into the universal-contract forge bundle on 2026-06-23 (CSV family). One source CSV: CIPCode2020.csv — the NCES CIP 2020 taxonomy. CIP is a pure 3-level taxonomy (2-digit domain -> 4-digit subdomain -> 6-digit program); every code is a DmeClass, the hierarchy is SUBCLASS_OF, intra-CIP cross-references are REFERENCES. The CSV carries NO CEDS columns: this is a standard-pure CIP block with no cross-standard edges and nothing stashed for bridging.
